  "period_note": "Solo basis. Cross-checked between the FY2013 report's own 'Five Years Performance' table (2012 column) and the FY2016 report's same-titled table (2012 column); all balance-sheet and income-statement figures agree exactly between the two. EXCEPTION: both reports print 'Required capital' for FY2012 as 111.46 crore, which is inconsistent with their own 'Capital excess/(shortfall)' row of 12.15 (would imply required capital of Total capital 1123.61 - 12.15 = 1111.46); this also equals 10% of the reported RWA (11114.59) exactly. Used the arithmetically-consistent 1111.46, treating the printed '111.46' as a dropped-leading-digit error reproduced identically in both source reports. Classified loans (22,627,888,000 Taka) recovered from the FY2014 report's Note 7.11 'Movement of classified loan' opening balance for 2013 (=closing FY2012); NPL% for FY2012 is reported ambiguously in the FY2013 report's own OCR-degraded 'Key Financial Ratios' table (a value of 26.07% appears but its year-attribution is unreliable - see npl_pct note) so the computed ratio is used instead. Required/maintained loan-loss provision (loans+off-balance-sheet, both 6,792,538,743 Taka - a zero shortfall) recovered from the FY2013 report's own Note 7.10 2012 comparative column. No EPS source found for FY2012; see eps note.",
